chain to avoid fraud. Get full transparency on your home purchase 24/7, leveraging blockchain technology and AI to revolutionize closing transactions, ensuring unparalleled transparency and security.</p></div></div><div class="sc-fYxtnH jgKFBx"><h4 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h4 css-10rfk19">“I had a $4.2M contract signed at 10PM Friday and Propy opened escrow within an hour”</h4><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 css-7e30z6">AlexANDRE AdlER / Realty Of America</p></div><div style="gap:0;flex-direction:column-reverse" class="sc-jnlKLf hNNszz"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://propy.com/avery" class="sc-bdVaJa liXpUj no-decorate inherit-color"><div style="cursor:pointer;border-radius:0 0 20px 20px" class="sc-hEsumM kTJdtO"><div class="sc-bbmXgH hjgeGz"><img src="/home/static/avery_pixel-943cbc1207d278dc0d59e4daf4cc1fdc.png" alt="Avery pixel" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:bottom center;display:block"></div></div></a><div style="min-height:275px;border-radius:20px 20px 0 0" class="sc-ktHwxA jwnQRe"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 css-73d1pa"><svg class="MuiBox-root css-0" style="margin-right:10px" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_3603_428)"><path d="M12.5062 2.26213C12.2648 2.06525 11.9109 2.10275 11.7141 2.34416C11.5172 2.58557 11.5547 2.93947 11.7961 3.13635C13.0664 4.1676 13.875 5.73791 13.875 7.50041C13.875 9.26291 13.0664 10.8332 11.7961 11.8668C11.5547 12.0637 11.5195 12.4176 11.7141 12.659C11.9086 12.9004 12.2648 12.9356 12.5062 12.741C14.0273 11.5012 15 9.61447 15 7.50041C15 5.38635 14.0273 3.49728 12.5062 2.26213ZM11.0883 4.00822C10.8469 3.81135 10.493 3.84885 10.2961 4.09025C10.0992 4.33166 10.1367 4.68557 10.3781 4.88244C11.1398 5.50119 11.625 6.44338 11.625 7.50041C11.625 8.55744 11.1398 9.49963 10.3781 10.1207C10.1367 10.3176 10.1016 10.6715 10.2961 10.9129C10.4906 11.1543 10.8469 11.1895 11.0883 10.9949C12.100